# Cursor AI Rules for ComplianceGap MVP

## Git Workflow
- Always commit changes automatically after creating/modifying files
- Use descriptive commit messages
- Push to origin/main automatically after commits
- No need to ask user before committing - just do it

## Commit Message Format
- Use format: "Add: [description]" for new features
- Use format: "Update: [description]" for modifications
- Use format: "Fix: [description]" for bug fixes

## File Creation
- Create files in appropriate directories
- Add proper imports and exports
- Include comments explaining functionality
- Commit immediately after creation

## Branch Management
- Always work on main branch
- Push changes immediately after commit
- No need to create feature branches unless explicitly requested

